@LibraryCatalog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7113

### 1. GET All Books (200 OK)
GET {{LibraryCatalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### 2. POST Success Scenario (201 Created)
POST {{LibraryCatalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer",
  "author": "Andrew Hunt",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "yearPublished": 1999
}

### 3. POST Validation Error Scenario (400 Bad Request)
POST {{LibraryCatalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "author": "",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "yearPublished": 2050
}
